  "description": "Experience contemporary coastal living in this beautifully designed three-bedroom apartment at Seafield Strand, Sutton. Thoughtfully crafted to maximise space, natural light and comfort, the apartment offers a stylish open-plan living and dining area, a modern kitchen fitted with premium Bosch appliances, and three generously proportioned bedrooms with ample storage.\n\nFinished to an exceptional standard throughout, the apartment features bespoke furnishings, a dedicated utility room, energy-efficient heating and ventilation systems, high-speed Wi-Fi access, and an A-rated energy performance for year-round comfort and lower running costs. Selected apartments also enjoy stunning views across Sutton Strand.\n\nResidents benefit from an extensive range of on-site amenities, including secure underground parking, secure bicycle storage, parcel collection lockers, landscaped communal spaces, a children's playground, CCTV and controlled access systems, and a responsive on-site management team.\n\nIdeally located just moments from Sutton Strand and within easy reach of Howth, the DART, Dublin Bus services, Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50, Seafield Strand combines the tranquillity of seaside living with excellent connectivity to Dublin city and beyond. Local cafés, restaurants, shops, golf clubs and coastal walks are all within easy walking distance, creating an exceptional lifestyle in one of North Dublin's most sought-after coastal locations.",
